If `externals` is empty, `new RegExp(globalsList.map(...).join('|'))` becomes `new RegExp('')`, which matches all code and can cause the transform to run far more often than intended. Consider guarding for `globalsList.length === 0` (e.g., skip registering the transform hook or use a non-matching regex) to avoid unnecessary work.
```suggestion
  const globalsCodeFilter =
    globalsList.length > 0 ? new RegExp(globalsList.map(escapeKeys).join('|')) : /$^/;
```

