**Precompute node→file lookup to avoid repeated full scans.**

`getModuleFileFromMap` does an O(N) scan and is invoked inside nested importer/imported traversals, which can become very expensive on large graphs. Build a reverse `WeakMap<ViteModuleNode, string>` once, then do O(1) lookups.


